'''Bloxx''' is the [[Omnitrix]]'s DNA sample of a [[Segmentasapien (Classic)|Segmentasapien]] from the planet [[Polyominus]].{{Refn|[[:File:Scan 9.png]]|group = OV Brief}}

==Appearance==
Being an organosillicon-based life form with segmented hardened quasi-organic polymer skin, Bloxx's body is made up of individual red, blue, and yellow building blocks that he can rearrange at will.{{Refn|[[:File:Segmentasapien Biology.png]]|group = DJW|name=Segmentasapien Physiology}}

Bloxx's default appearance looks similar to that of a [[Wikipedia:Gorilla|gorilla]] made of mostly red and yellow building blocks with some blue blocks. He has black lines and studs all over his body. His feet are stubs and his hands are extremely large to balance most of his body. Bloxx wears the [[Omnitrix (Omniverse)|Omnitrix]] symbol on his chest.

