Bloxx is made out of expendable individual blocks that his body can constantly generate or rearrange without any limit, giving him a precise control over his shape and size.{{Refn|group=DJW|name=Segmentasapien Physiology}} He can grow several stories tall, quickly regenerate lost limbs and head, as well as create any physical construct, such as  a wall,<ref name="Have I Got a Deal for You" /> catapult,<ref name="TMTCP1" /> slide,<ref>''[[It's a Mad, Mad, Mad Ben World: Part 2]]''</ref> and dome.<ref name="RMP" /> If not needed anymore, his body can either absorb those blocks back to itself or detach them at will, allowing him to escape danger.<ref name="AD">''[[Arrested Development]]''</ref>

Bloxx can extend his arms to great lengths on their own without creating more blocks to make them longer. This allows him to easily transfer big gaps and cover more ground when walking on his hands, as shown when he was crossing over several buildings while chasing the [[Screegit]] and caught up to it.<ref name="Have I Got a Deal for You">''[[Have I Got a Deal for You]]''</ref>

Bloxx can turn his hands into guns dubbed Bloxx-Lobbers<ref>[[Shocksquatch]]</ref><ref>''[[Third Time's a Charm]]''</ref> and fire explosive blocks from them as projectiles.<ref name="RMP">''[[Rad Monster Party]]''</ref> The blocks are also painful to step on, as seen when [[Humungousaur (Classic)|Humungousaur]] used them to pain [[Khyber]] as [[Tyrannopede]] into releasing him from his mouth.<ref>''[[Stuck on You]]''</ref>

Bloxx has enhanced strength, able to punch into a [[Dimension 12]] robot and shut it down,<ref name="AD" /> pull rocks straight out of the ground,<ref>''[[Bros in Space]]''</ref> generate a shockwave by slamming his fists into the ground,<ref>''[[A Jolt From the Past]]''</ref> and carry [[Fistrick]].<ref>''[[Universe vs. Tennyson]]''</ref>

Bloxx is very dense and durable, being able to survive being shot multiple times,<ref name="TMTCP1">''[[The More Things Change: Part 1]]''</ref> beaten down by [[Albedo|Negative]] [[Ultimate Humungousaur]],<ref>''[[For a Few Brains More]]''</ref> and crushed by [[Ma Vreedle]].<ref name="OMWAT">''[[O Mother, Where Art Thou?]]''</ref> 

Bloxx can jump exceptionally high, as he was able to leap up to a high platform where Ma Vreedle was. He also has good reflexes, as he could swiftly dodge one of her shots and punch the others with precise timing.<ref name="OMWAT" />

Similar to [[Cannonbolt (Classic)|Cannonbolt]], Bloxx can encase people or objects inside his body, as shown when he caught the [[Gracklflint]],<ref>''[[Rad]]''</ref> and protected [[Rook Blonko|Rook]] from dying in the [[Earth (Classic)|Earth]]'s atmosphere.<ref name="Breakpoint">''[[Breakpoint]]''</ref>

Bloxx also gains similar abilities to Cannonbolt when in his sphere form, such as increased speed, and being able to see where he is going when rolling around.<ref name="AD" />

Because he is made of building blocks, Bloxx can survive in the vacuum of space. He is also immune to extremely high amounts of heat and radiation, as seen when falling through Earth's atmosphere.<ref name="Breakpoint" />

