==History==
===Omniverse===
*Bloxx first appeared in ''[[The More Things Change: Part 1]]'', where he saved [[Ignacius Baumann|Mr. Baumann]]'s shop from being destroyed with [[Rook Blonko|Rook]]'s help.{{Refn|Despite first being used in ''[[The More Things Change: Part 1]]'', Bloxx was never locked in the [[Omnitrix (Omniverse)|Omnitrix]].{{Refn|[[:File:New Aliens in OV Weren't Locked.png]]|group = DJW}}|group = note}}
*In ''[[A Jolt From the Past]]'', Bloxx defeated [[Fistrick]]'s [[Fistrick's Thug|thug]] and [[Hoodlum]].
*In ''[[Have I Got a Deal for You]]'', Bloxx saved a train from falling off a bridge before battling the [[Screegit]] and contained it long enough for [[Blarney T. Hokestar|Professor Hokestar]] to revert the Screegit to its original form.
*In ''[[Many Happy Returns]]'', Bloxx stopped a [[Tetramand (Classic)|Tetramand]] warship from attacking [[Ben's Team (Omniverse)|his team]].
*In ''[[Bros in Space]]'', Bloxx made the process of extracting the [[Amber Ogia]] on [[Revonnah]] easier.
*In ''[[Arrested Development]]'', 11-year-old [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] as Bloxx defeated some [[Dimension 12]] robots.
*In ''[[Rules of Engagement]]'', Bloxx blocked the way of [[Julie Yamamoto|Julie]] and [[Hervé]] so he could explain himself to the former.
*In ''[[T.G.I.S.]]'', Bloxx saved [[Zak Saturday|Zak]] from [[V.V. Argost|Argost]].
*In ''[[Rad]]'', Bloxx tried to catch the [[Gracklflint]], but failed and helped [[Rad Dudesman]] make a trap for it.
*In ''[[The Frogs of War: Part 1]]'', Bloxx saved himself and Rook when they crashed into [[Milleous]]' ship.
*In ''[[O Mother, Where Art Thou?]]'', Bloxx was defeated by [[Ma Vreedle]].
*In ''[[For a Few Brains More]]'', Bloxx took [[Azmuth (Classic)|Azmuth]]'s brain from [[Ultimate Albedo]] and was defeated by [[Albedo|Negative]] [[Ultimate Humungousaur]].
*In ''[[Rad Monster Party]]'', Bloxx battled [[Dr. Viktor]] and [[Zs'Skayr]].
*In ''[[Universe vs. Tennyson]]'', Bloxx saved himself, Mr. Baumann, and Fistrick from crashing before trapping the latter so Rook could arrest him.
*In ''[[Rook Tales]]'', Bloxx was defeated by [[Kundo]].
*In ''[[Breakpoint]]'', Bloxx saved Rook from being burnt to death in the [[Earth (Classic)|Earth]]'s atmosphere before he reverted.
*In ''[[It's a Mad, Mad, Mad Ben World: Part 2]]'', Bloxx and [[Handyman]] gave water to the enslaved Benwood citizens.
*In ''[[Stuck on You]]'', [[Skurd]] gave [[Humungousaur (Classic)|Humungousaur]] the Bloxx-Lobber to fight [[Khyber]] as [[Tyrannopede]].
*In ''[[Let's Do the Time War Again]]'', Skurd gave [[Gravattack]] the Bloxx-Lobber to catch the [[Time Beast]].
*In ''[[Third Time's a Charm]]'', Skurd gave [[Shocksquatch]] the Bloxx-Lobber to battle [[Charmcaster (Classic)|Charmcaster]].
*In ''[[Malgax Attacks]]'', Skurd gave [[Whampire]] a pair of Bloxx-Lobbers to fight [[Malware Armor|Mal]][[Vilgax (Classic)|gax]].
*In ''[[A New Dawn]]'', Bloxx appeared for a short time when Ben was cycling through his aliens.

