==Etymology==
Bloxx's name is a play on the word "blocks", which alludes to what he is made out of.

==Trivia==
*Bloxx was first revealed in a [[Wikipedia:Bandai|Bandai]] Toy Fair display for '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]'''.
*Bloxx was created by [[Dwayne McDuffie]].{{Refn|[[:File:Bloxx Was Created By Dwayne McDuffie.png]]|group = CM}}
**During production, Bloxx's working name was Blox.{{Refn|[[:File:Bloxx Model Sheet.png]]|group = DJW}}
**Bloxx was largely designed by [[Steven Choi]].{{Refn|[[:File:Steven Choi Designed Bloxx.png]]|group = SC}} Derrick, however, made notes on some existing rough concepts of Bloxx before he changed the design of his head.{{Refn|[[:File:Derrick's Contributions to OV Aliens.png]]|group = DJW}}
*The blocks that Bloxx's body is made of resemble plastic bricks of the [[Wikipedia:Lego|LEGO]] construction toy brand. Similarly, they are exceptionally durable and painful to step on.
**Related to this, U.K. fans of '''[[Ben 10 (Franchise)|Ben 10]]''' won a Guinness World Record in October 2012 after 15,556 people took part in a successful attempt to break the Guinness World Record for the most contributors to a sculpture made of interlocking plastic bricks, depicting Bloxx. The final statue had taken around 570 hours to complete and used somewhere around 240,000 bricks. It was designed by Kevin Cooper from KC Designs.{{Refn|[[:File:Bloxx Lego World Record.png]]|group = GWR}} The participants were given certificates.

